{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Sanctum</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Fantasy Hybrid of Dungeon Management, RTS, and Third-Person Action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the shadow of the Sanctum Mountains, an ancient power stirs. In <i>Dominar Sanctum</i>, you are not just a commander watching from above. You are the heart of the hive. Carve out your domain, breed loyal minions, and prepare to defend your territory against the powers that dwell in the deep.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Architect Your Domain</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Command:</strong> Architect your fortress from the ground up. Manage resources, expand your influence, and strategically place defenses to crush intruders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become What You Breed:</strong> Recruit a diverse army of minions. Every unit has a purpose, and your success depends on how you shape and lead your forces.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seize Direct Control</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Possession:</strong> Take total control. At any moment, leap into the perspective of your Champions or possess your minions to turn the tide of battle in visceral third-person combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hybrid Warfare:</strong> Seamlessly blend high-level RTS strategy with real-time spellcasting and melee action. Lead from the throne, or fight from the mud.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Claim Your Throne</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The depths are calling. Will you rise as the ultimate ruler of the Sanctum, or fall to the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Dominar Sanctum now to begin your conquest.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087340?t=1774867433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat