rpose, and your success depends on how you shape and lead your forces.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seize Direct Control</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Possession:</strong> Take total control. At any moment, leap into the perspective of your Champions or possess your minions to turn the tide of battle in visceral third-person combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hybrid Warfare:</strong> Seamlessly blend high-level RTS strategy with real-time spellcasting and melee action. Lead from the throne, or fight from the mud.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Claim Your Throne</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The depths are calling. Will you rise as the ultimate ruler of the Sanctum, or fall to the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Dominar Sanctum now to begin your conquest.</strong></p>","developers":["Florisworlds GmbH"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087340/311f0759d2010e0278e79633cf3e95f286bf26cb/header.jpg?t=1774867433","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4087340/1461020094/592d476d02852c77246d9a2e6f441f9f35e19cf4/1773422580/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773426718","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4087340/1461020094/592d476d02852c77246d9a2e6f441f9f35e19cf4/1773422580/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773426718","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4087340/1461020094/592d476d02852c77246d9a2e6f441f9f35e19cf4/1773422580/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773426718","id":257303225,"name":"Gameplay Trailer Dominar Sanctum","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257303225/ba35a3855bcae87c8cfe749641a25933752851fd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773426718"}],"name":"Dominar Sanctum","package_groups":[],"pc_